# Light the night shift
@scenario office_lesson_24
@include /definitions/characters.vns
@label start
[mode dialogue standard]
[set ui.dialogueUi project]
[bg office]
[char pip global on]
[set ui.dialogueFadeMs 160]
[stage clear]
[show pip desk neutral]
pip: The late shift uses a cooler room and a warm pool of light near the desk. Watch the wall and the desk.
[stage dusk]
[if !tutorial_still]
[move pip desk stride-a-right exprdur=0]
[move pip window ease_in_out_cubic 640]
[wait 160]
[move pip window stride-b-right exprdur=0]
[wait 160]
[move pip window stride-c-right exprdur=0]
[wait 160]
[move pip window stride-b-right exprdur=0]
[wait 160]
[move pip window point exprdur=90]
[endif]
pip: Look at the edge of the desk.
[stage clear]
[if !tutorial_still]
[move pip window stride-a-left exprdur=0]
[move pip desk ease_out_cubic 510]
[wait 120]
[move pip desk stride-b-left exprdur=0]
[wait 120]
[move pip desk stride-c-left exprdur=0]
[wait 120]
[move pip desk stride-b-left exprdur=0]
[wait 150]
[move pip desk neutral exprdur=90]
[endif]
pip: Open the dusk preset in Lighting Studio. Change exposure, apply it, and compare the same beat in Puppeteer.
@label check
pip: How do you restore the original room in VNS?
> Hide Pip. -> retry
> Use the stage clear command. -> correct
@label retry
[show pip desk curious]
pip: Clearing the active stage restores the ungraded background. Give it another try.
[jump check]
@label correct
[show pip desk cheer]
pip: Clearing the active stage restores the ungraded background.
> Finish this lesson -> return_hub
> Try the lesson again -> start
@label return_hub
[if !tutorial_done_24]
[flag tutorial_done_24]
[inc tutorial_count]
[endif]
[stage clear]
[goto TutorialHub:topics_page_5]
